Each dot represents one dolphin counted in a recorded sighting. The x-axis shows the month, the y-axis shows the estimated number of dolphins in that dolphin’s sighting, and the color shows the year. The dots are not individually identified dolphins; survey effort may vary by month and year.

library(tidyverse)

